  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Grants to Young Scientists in Middle East Developing Countries for Transformative Research and Collaborations with German Scientists</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The proposed project aims at providing seed opportunities for young researchers returning to the Middle East as well as for diaspora from countries of the Middle East. In addition, the programme is designed and structured to favour the conditions for establishing scientific research of high standard, with training of students as a major component. 
There will also be a strong emphasis on catalyzing collaborations with German scientists for interdisciplinary research, with emphasis on the six key areas of the &#x2018;High-Tech Agenda Germany&#x2019;.
The project thus will not only produce a new workforce of young and talented scientists for the future of countries in the Middle East, but also promote and foster a culture of education and science-based development mindful of the sustainability challenges faced by communities throughout the MENA Region.</narrative>
  </description>
